WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.805 --> 00:00:15.746
Black Wind King took a step back.

2
00:00:16.647 --> 00:00:17.768
He looked confused.

3
00:00:18.889 --> 00:00:21.050
"That pill jumped down my throat!"

4
00:00:24.572 --> 00:00:26.794
entire cave filled with light.

5
00:00:27.735 --> 00:00:31.292
The bear squeezed his eyes shut.

6
00:00:31.352 --> 00:00:34.434
When he opened them, Guanyin was standing before him.

7
00:00:34.454 --> 00:00:37.916
"Guanyin!" the bear cried.

8
00:00:37.936 --> 00:00:40.738
"You tricked me with a disguise!"

9
00:00:40.758 --> 00:00:44.460
"Return the robe at once," said Guanyin.

10
00:00:46.761 --> 00:00:48.042
said the Black Wind King.

11
00:00:51.864 --> 00:00:54.226
don't want to Ugh."

12
00:00:55.487 --> 00:00:57.588
He held his stomach and groaned.

13
00:00:58.708 --> 00:00:59.809
"Are you feeling okay?"

14
00:01:00.129 --> 00:01:01.371
asked Wukong's voice.

15
00:01:02.692 --> 00:01:04.473
bear looked around, surprised.

16
00:01:04.493 --> 00:01:07.056
"I just heard the monkey!"

17
00:01:08.837 --> 00:01:10.819
fell to his knees and groaned again.

18
00:01:10.839 --> 00:01:14.442
"Where are you?"

19
00:01:15.704 --> 00:01:16.444
inside you!"

20
00:01:16.765 --> 00:01:17.585
said Wukong.

21
00:01:17.605 --> 00:01:21.088
"I changed myself into a pill to trick you.

22
00:01:22.169 --> 00:01:24.652
Now I'm going to practice some of my fighting skills!"

23
00:01:25.804 --> 00:01:28.725
The monkey punched and kicked the bear's insides.

24
00:01:30.345 --> 00:01:31.566
Pow! Boomph!

25
00:01:31.986 --> 00:01:34.826
Pow! "Aargh!"

26
00:01:35.087 --> 00:01:37.747
cried the Black Wind King, rolling on the floor.

27
00:01:39.508 --> 00:01:43.669
Wukong jumped up and down, did flips, and ran around in circles.

28
00:01:45.849 --> 00:01:48.470
stop!" shouted the Black Wind King.

29
00:01:48.490 --> 00:01:51.331
"You're hurting my belly!"

30
00:01:51.411 --> 00:01:56.096
"Give back the robe," said Guanyin.

31
00:01:56.156 --> 00:01:57.978
"I will, I promise!"

32
00:01:58.338 --> 00:01:58.978
said the bear.

33
00:02:00.319 --> 00:02:01.820
will do anything you say!

34
00:02:02.441 --> 00:02:05.443
Just please tell the monkey to stop!"

35
00:02:07.384 --> 00:02:09.766
Guanyin held up a metal headband.

36
00:02:10.586 --> 00:02:13.028
It looked just like the one on Wukong's head.

37
00:02:14.108 --> 00:02:15.990
She placed it on the bear's head.

38
00:02:16.010 --> 00:02:20.153
"Wukong, come out now," said Guanyin.

39
00:02:21.093 --> 00:02:24.836
A tiny Wukong popped out of the Black Wind King's nose.

40
00:02:25.972 --> 00:02:28.534
He quickly grew to his normal size.

41
00:02:28.554 --> 00:02:30.535
"Where's the robe?"

42
00:02:30.936 --> 00:02:31.676
asked the monkey.

43
00:02:32.797 --> 00:02:36.099
The bear pointed to a dark room in the back of the cave.

44
00:02:37.761 --> 00:02:42.864
After Wukong left to get the robe, the Black Wind King charged at Guanyin.

45
00:02:45.626 --> 00:02:46.927
the bear was too slow.

46
00:02:47.828 --> 00:02:50.670
Guanyin threw four more metal bands at him.

47
00:02:52.131 --> 00:02:53.572
clamped onto his wrists.

48
00:02:54.496 --> 00:02:57.578
The other two clamped onto his ankles.

49
00:02:59.159 --> 00:03:03.141
When the bodhisattva began reciting a spell, the bear screamed.

50
00:03:04.381 --> 00:03:06.603
"Please stop!"

51
00:03:06.623 --> 00:03:09.704
"Do you promise to be good?"

52
00:03:10.064 --> 00:03:10.885
asked Guanyin.

53
00:03:10.905 --> 00:03:14.747
"Yes!" answered the Black Wind King.

54
00:03:14.767 --> 00:03:16.988
"I promise."

55
00:03:19.009 --> 00:03:20.230
came back with the robe.

56
00:03:21.330 --> 00:03:25.108
When he saw the bear, he laughed.

57
00:03:25.168 --> 00:03:26.989
"You have five of those bands!"

58
00:03:28.110 --> 00:03:31.072
The Black Wind King looked at the ground and sighed.

59
00:03:31.092 --> 00:03:35.896
"I got the robe, Bodhisattva," said the monkey.

60
00:03:35.916 --> 00:03:37.817
"What should we do with the bear?"

61
00:03:37.837 --> 00:03:41.700
"I will show him mercy," said Guanyin.

62
00:03:41.720 --> 00:03:46.783
"He can be my guardian on Mount Potalaka if he behaves."

63
00:03:49.465 --> 00:03:53.148
The bodhisattva led the bear out of the cave and vanished.

64
00:03:56.552 --> 00:03:58.833
Wukong flew back to the monastery.

65
00:03:58.853 --> 00:04:02.274
"You got the robe!"

66
00:04:02.614 --> 00:04:04.715
cried the Tang Monk when he saw the monkey.

67
00:04:04.735 --> 00:04:07.055
"I did," said Wukong.

68
00:04:08.896 --> 00:04:10.956
The two travelers headed west again.

69
00:04:11.937 --> 00:04:15.458
Wukong told the monk about his adventure with the Black Wind King.

70
00:04:15.478 --> 00:04:19.939
"I destroyed the Daoist priest," the monkey explained.

71
00:04:21.139 --> 00:04:23.120
"He was really an evil wolf spirit.

72
00:04:24.288 --> 00:04:26.169
Then Guanyin made herself look like him."

73
00:04:26.189 --> 00:04:30.151
"And you turned yourself into a pill," said the Tang Monk.

74
00:04:31.991 --> 00:04:34.433
"And I went right into that bear's belly."

75
00:04:35.113 --> 00:04:36.133
Wukong laughed.

76
00:04:36.153 --> 00:04:38.914
"He was very surprised!"

77
00:04:40.075 --> 00:04:41.316
Tang Monk smiled.

78
00:04:41.336 --> 00:04:44.317
"I think we both learned a valuable lesson, Wukong.

79
00:04:45.657 --> 00:04:47.918
I will never show anyone the robe again."

80
00:04:47.938 --> 00:04:51.260
"That's a good idea," said Wukong.

81
00:04:52.944 --> 00:04:54.305
robe is a gift from Buddha.

82
00:04:55.066 --> 00:05:00.689
We must be careful He stopped talking and pulled out his iron bar.

83
00:05:01.970 --> 00:05:02.891
a spirit nearby."

84
00:05:03.951 --> 00:05:05.672
He looked toward a nearby cave.

85
00:05:08.154 --> 00:05:08.894
was a snort.

86
00:05:09.695 --> 00:05:11.796
The Tang Monk shook with fear.

87
00:05:12.957 --> 00:05:17.580
A pig-like creature leaped from the cave, swinging a heavy rake.
